            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "http://www.kipt.kharkov.ua/conferences/itp/DV2000/dvbiogr.html"} obituary
            %li
              %p
                Interview with Dmitry Volkov by Yuri Ranyuk, Imperial College, London March 1995 (
                %a{:href => "https://www.aip.org/history-programs/niels-bohr-library/oral-histories/4392"}> aip oral histories:4392
                )
            %li
              %p
                S. I. Volkova,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Aleksandr+A.+Zheltukhin"} Aleksandr A. Zheltukhin
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Glimpses of Dmitry Volkov’s life and work
                %strong 101
                1–3 (2001) 20-25 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0920-5632(01)01489-X"}> doi:10.1016/S0920-5632(01)01489-X
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                A.S. Bakai, S. V. Peletminskii, N.F. Shul’ga, Yu.V. Slyusarenko, D.V. Uvarov, A.A. Zheltukhin,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em To the 90-th anniversary of Dmitry Vasilievich Volkov’s birthday
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1506.03003"} arXiv:1506.03003
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steven+Duplij"}> Steven Duplij
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supergravity was discovered by D.V. Volkov and V.A. Soroka in 1973, wasn’t it?
              %p
                (
                %a{:href => "https://periodicals.karazin.ua/eejp/article/view/14364"}> Journal version
                ), (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.03259"}> arXiv:1910.03259
                )
          %h2#selected_writings Selected writings:
          %p
            The idea of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity"} supergravity
            was proposed by
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitry+Volkov"}> Dmitry Volkov
              , V. P. Akulov,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Possible universal neutrino interaction
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.jetpletters.ac.ru/ps/1766/article_26864.shtml"} pdf
          %p followed up by the first model of supergravity (in nonlinear realization) constructed in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitry+Volkov"} Dmitry Volkov
              and
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vyacheslav+Soroka"} Vyacheslav Soroka
              = succeed "," do
                %em Higgs effect for Goldstone particles with spin 1/2
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.jetpletters.ac.ru/ps/1568/article_24038.shtml"} pdf
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D4+supergravity"} D=4 supergravity
            formulated in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superspace"} superspace
          %ul
            %li
              V. Akulov,
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitry+Volkov"} Dmitry Volkov
              and
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vyacheslav+Soroka"} Vyacheslav Soroka
              = succeed "," do
                %em Generally covariant theories of gauge fields on superspace
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01041233"} doi:10.1007/BF01041233
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Freund-Rubin+compactification"} Freund-Rubin compactification
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D11+supergravity"} D=11
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D10+supergravity"} D=10 supergravity
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitri+P.+Sorokin"}> Dmitri P. Sorokin
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vladimir+I.+Tkach"} Vladimir I. Tkach
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitrij+V.+Volkov"} Dmitrij V. Volkov
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  On the relationship between compactified vacua of
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi D
                        %mo =
                        %mn 11
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D=11
                  and
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi D
                        %mo =
                        %mn 10
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D=10
                  supergravities
              %strong 161
              (1985) 301-306 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(85)90766-X"}> doi:10.1016/0370-2693(85)90766-X
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Om the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+particle"} super particle
            and the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spinning+particle"} spinning particle
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitri+P.+Sorokin"}> Dmitri P. Sorokin
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vladimir+I.+Tkach"} Vladimir I. Tkach
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitrij+V.+Volkov"} Dmitrij V. Volkov
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Aleksandr+A.+Zheltukhin"} Aleksandr A. Zheltukhin
              = succeed "," do
                %em From the Superparticle Siegel Symmetry to the Spinning Particle Proper Time Supersymmetry
              %strong 216
              (1989) 302-306 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(89)91119-2"}> doi:10.1016/0370-2693(89)91119-2
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On the history of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity"} supergravity
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitry+Volkov"}> Dmitry Volkov
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Supergravity before and after 1976. The story of goldstonions
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://www.springer.com/gp/book/9781402013386"} Concise Encyclopedia of Supersymmetry, Springer, 2004
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9404153"}> arXiv:hep-th/9404153
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/kappa-symmetry"} kappa-symmetry
            explained via the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superembedding+approach"} superembedding approach
          %ul
            %li#SorokinTkachVolkov89
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitri+Sorokin"}> Dmitri Sorokin
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vladimir+Tkach"} Vladimir Tkach
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitrij+Volkov"} Dmitrij Volkov
              = succeed "," do
                %em Superparticles, twistors and Siegel symmetry
              %strong 4
              10 (1989) 901-908 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/271923"}> spire:271923
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/S0217732389001064"} doi:10.1142/S0217732389001064
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superstrings"} superstrings
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+membranes"} super membranes
            formulated in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superspace"} superspace
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Bandos"}> Igor Bandos
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitrij+Sorokin"} Dmitrij Sorokin
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitrij+Volkov"} Dmitrij Volkov
              = succeed "," do
                %em On the generalized action principle for superstrings and supermembranes
              %strong 352
              (1995) 269-275 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9502141"}> arXiv:hep-th/9502141
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On the derivation of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equations+of+motion"} equations of motion
            for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superstring"} superstring
            and the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-brane"} M2-brane
            via the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superembedding+approach"} superembedding approach
          %ul
            %li#BPSTV95
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Bandos"}> Igor Bandos
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paolo+Pasti"} Paolo Pasti
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitri+Sorokin"} Dmitri Sorokin
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mario+Tonin"} Mario Tonin
              = succeed "," do
